{"genre": "art"}], "nc": 49}, {"id": 2646322, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "ちやこ▽9件作業中", "screen_name": "chi_12px", "avatar_url": "https://proxy.misskeyusercontent.jp/avatar/media.misskeyusercontent.jp%2Fio%2F2d6dd8c5-2a05-4897-a373-309fcd6e29ae.png?avatar=1", "header_url": "https://media.misskeyusercontent.jp/io/b5b18a46-3c69-42b6-b357-87bc585e1145.png", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "comic"}], "nc": 145}, {"id": 3138787, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "あいす", "screen_name": "Ice_compass0610", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1870209979631972352/trVCfBqs.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1038805897387028480/1747502592/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "nc": 144}]}, "price_history": {"art": [{"amount": 5000, "recorded_at": "2025-09-27T01:00:00.552976"}, {"amount": 10000, "recorded_at": "2025-10-10T18:57:28.640180"}], "correction": [{"amount": 1000, "recorded_at": "2025-09-27T01:00:00.552976"}, {"amount": 1000, "recorded_at": "2025-10-10T18:57:28.640180"}]}, "works": [{"path": "/@yobi45697/works/2", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 3761805, "client_id": 3332918, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/cc26a47d/uploads/origins/9d35c468-132d-45ae-acd0-a01ff8579088?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5718791893c654b103dc4afc170412f2", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/cc26a47d/uploads/origins/9d35c468-132d-45ae-acd0-a01ff8579088?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=7e9fe3be3b852d2c0f44ba53600f2a03", "src_set": ""}, "body": "櫂様はじめまして！\n櫂様の繊細な絵柄に一目惚れし、この度はリクエストを送らせていただきました。\n\n自分と友人のオリジナルキャラクターのイラストをぜひ櫂様の絵柄で拝見したいと思っています。\n構図はおまかせ、シチュエーションとしては「桜の舞う季節」「初めて顔を突き合わせる(男性側の一目惚れの瞬間」場面をお願いしたいです。\n資料はなるべく多くのものを提出したかったためいろんな衣装のものを添付しておりますが、衣装は和服のものだと嬉しいです！(複雑なデザインなので描きやすいように簡略化してください)\nまたイラストは個人的なグッズ作成(ポストカードに印刷等、飾りたいと思っています)にも使用したいです。もし難しそうであればこちらのリクエストは却下していただけると幸いです。\n※商用利用はなく、自分と友人用のみの観賞用です。\n\n以下キャラクター情報\n男性：薬師神 穂希\n身長178cm\n穏やかで優しい男に見えるが、実際のところなににも興味がない空虚な人間。腹黒い一面がある。\n一目惚れで後述する妻にゾッコン、独占欲の塊で現在は妻至上主義。\n女性：薬師神 来夢(現在妻なのですが、初対面時の関係性としては遠い親戚)\n身長159cm\n明るく好奇心旺盛な人間。自己中心的で奔放に生きている。\n血筋にコンプレックスがあり、穂希の家のことが嫌い。穂希のことも初対面時ではよく思っていない(いろいろあり今は愛しています)。\n自分の容姿が優れている自覚があり、それについて褒められることに飽き飽きしている。\nイラストでは顔を顰めていたりするより、びっくりしていたりきょとんとしている表情が見れると嬉しいです！\n\n長文になってしまい、また指定が多くすみません。\nご多忙のところ誠に恐縮ですが、宜しければご検討いただけると幸いです。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1lh2IUc-z0Q58QlN9B1Fr1pCvsE9sfEQB?usp=share_link", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@yobi45697/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3761805, "client_id": 2495946, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/b2668e45/uploads/origins/4a14d3a7-fcb4-4c18-b8cf-9b5f5eb871fb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=522c4f804c07891b1abd4962facc4eff", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/b2668e45/uploads/origins/4a14d3a7-fcb4-4c18-b8cf-9b5f5eb871fb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=ea4e6e5d72bbf2f1914246928423789f", "src_set": ""}, "body": "Hello sensei!! It's nice to meet you. I love your Wuthering Waves and Arknight artworks. May I make a request?\n\n✨️ Characters\n[1] Quinn\nMale. 168cm.\nQuinn at first is not very kind, often cynical and critical of others while maintaining a sharp tongue. He keeps his walls up, and finds it hard to trust others. He pushes people away, finds it hard to care, but once he does care he is thoughtful and it is something he would find embarrassing. Cat-like. Smart. He is a healer / medic in most universes. Heterochromia eyes, one is lighter than the other. \n\n[2] Alphard\nMale. 170cm.\nAlphard appears like a guy who only cares for profit. He doesn't get close to anyone except for work and parts his ways with others whenever the job is done. He likes to prove himself and brag about his greatness, making him seem like a narcissistic show off. Despite that, he cares greatly about other people and tries to minimize damages and puts great efforts keeping the group together during jobs. He is usually seen in the \"default outfit\". He has one blue eye and one yellow eye and the lights in his eyes look like sparkles.\n\n✨️ Relationship\nThey are a couple, though at first, they didn't like each other. They love to playfully argue, but they also take good care of each other. Due to their similarities, they often feel like they are the only ones who are able to understand one another. They have both kept their distance from other people for so long, and as a result they do not know how to handle their emotions well, at times being shy around each other.\n\n✨️ Request\nI love these artworks of yours the most:\nhttps://x.com/yobi45697/status/1954157463244345738?t=Lh4CBjTNX9OKXrfrYzbQsQ&s=19\nhttps://x.com/yobi45697/status/1951623767945339152?t=vUhiYO0vjA-qMsT8deHG0w&s=19\nhttps://x.com/yobi45697/status/1953072566635294889?t=ZXf_KthaFVI8Shy-q_ZD4g&s=19\n\nIf possible, I would love it if you could draw them resting under a tree. I would love to see Quinn resting on Alphard's lap and them talking and laughing together.\n\nFeel free to choose the poses and compositions.\n\n✨️References \nhttps://peapup.notion.site/quinoa-26a8ee95900280d99005cd1403e53953\n\nThank you for your consideration!", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "from_archive": true}